@baseUrl = http://localhost:3002/api/customers

### 1. Healthcheck Customer Service
GET http://localhost:3002/health

###

### 2. Tao Customer moi
# @name createCustomerRequest
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "c0cf38a0-f353-4db4-896c-ed16b48e92ef",
  "fullName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "email": "nguyenvana@example.com",
  "phone": "0901234567"
}

###

### Biến tự động lấy customerId từ response tạo Customer mới
@customerId = {{createCustomerRequest.response.body.data.id}}

### 3. Lay thong tin Customer theo ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{customerId}}
